### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Contacts API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts

### (getContactById)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ac8ae5a7cf30af08dd0a170

### (addContact)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alice Dupont",
    "age": 31
}

### (updateContact)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af1fb9e891a5a4a73f33fbd
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bob Martin",
    "age": 56
}


### (removeContact)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af1f8e6f8b6f5f840eb74c3


### docs
GET http://localhost:5000/docs/#/default/get_contacts


### créer un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alice@test.fr",
    "password": "motdepasse"
}

### se connecter (faut copier le token de la réponse)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alice@test.fr",
    "password": "motdepasse"
}

### route protégée sans token : doit renvoyer 401
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts

### route protégée avec token : doit renvoyer 200
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhZmYxNmY3YWFkM2JmMTBkZTNhZThjYiIsImVtYWlsIjoiYWxpY2VAdGVzdC5mciIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTEwMjc0MCwiZXhwIjoxNzk1MTA2MzQwfQ.fXckOkDVcigI95mMtkuzLW5Suy0aOJXX80hkcYSF6JM


# version automatisée avec variable token
### @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@test.fr", "password": "motdepasse" }


@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
